an style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">안</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 대하여 의견이 있는 경우 아래 양식에 따라 작성하시어 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012.6.20(</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #ffffff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 12:00&nbsp; </span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">까지 교무처로 제출하여 주시기 바라며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">동 기간 내에 회신이 없을</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼